#: scenario2:scenario2_199A37CC_E988_4B72_800C_A64861EC0549
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fda548cd73a818f70baed03b7123c89004572f9c5b5ea84237fceef5fdb21fd
