msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Then... ⟪k:3⟫I suppose I shall take you up on your generosity."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah... ⟪k:3⟫Très bien, je vais accepter votre généreuse offre."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4085474D_5FA7_4CF4_ABDB_FDCE6F5B07F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 441c6396a58c5746897049b7206a292065e65f1fab9a55d813da4c931de71f0b
