msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I have been wandering for a very, very long time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Cela fait très, très longtemps que je marche."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E8E33C0F_1C5D_4935_86C2_6AEC7C6A29BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c9b0430733364af02d073f2e515278f35a6cf8a7ea0098995c52ac2b6d7e72a
#. default-sha256: 586fba55cf4b545c5c288db009afca6620959b3ed104e9084dd52ccc13796515
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E8E33C0F_1C5D_4935_86C2_6AEC7C6A29BE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What was that, Master? ⟪k:1⟫You recognize her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Qu’y a-t-il, Maître ? ⟪k:1⟫Vous la reconnaissez ?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0789AA8F_5FF4_4FC9_AC02_874445FF7FDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f47ae81ae11baf95f81b21d0ec856a55b4c075d429305615ab1c38151e58b97
#. default-sha256: 52ffd4ef013e099a87928ee2cddf64fb8211b3d413de11a873973a43f708b10e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0789AA8F_5FF4_4FC9_AC02_874445FF7FDD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine you would. ⟪k:1⟫That white hair, those red eyes, skin the color of freshly fallen "
"snow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je m’en doutais. ⟪k:1⟫Ces cheveux blancs, ces yeux rouges, cette peau de neige fraîchement "
"tombée."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2E741487_927A_4B6B_8150_D002B616BB04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 356f22bb3ea317e960ce32d2996d9ecbd35c3769f7f9c99ebc499909ace34d40
#. default-sha256: 3a168d4ca336b4c54bd092690beff1b33cea6c9756c72b6f4d3d32c2d29bc71e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2E741487_927A_4B6B_8150_D002B616BB04"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And that flawlessly beautiful visage... ⟪k:1⟫you could not possibly mistake her for anyone "
"else. ⟪k:2⟫And no, it is not someone who happens to resemble her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et ce beau visage sans défaut... ⟪k:1⟫il est impossible de la prendre pour quelqu’un "
"d’autre. ⟪k:2⟫Et non, ce n’est pas quelqu’un qui lui ressemble."

#: scenario2:scenario2_58773568_08FB_4D1E_82D8_4F1AA27D2A86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97c538beeebdc5fe957b9041d46c3add869a33a31bca2dde7dc4893723840c2e
#. default-sha256: c6ec341e53362be9f6b7fa45dc43b1f2e6f74ea593623718c82c98118991e6bb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_58773568_08FB_4D1E_82D8_4F1AA27D2A86"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I can understand why you would be surprised, Master. ⟪k:1⟫At first, I could hardly believe "
"my own eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je peux comprendre votre surprise, Maître. ⟪k:1⟫Au début, je n’en croyais pas mes yeux."

#: scenario2:scenario2_DE5B9B47_1A1E_40BC_B96E_D4A5B1CFF55C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6e0f8adde2e76a8c94dc03215ae7362ee1eff09c81440884bd5c153ce5b2438
#. default-sha256: 59f0a7abcc5aa3b94df79b3c5ae0867d86c4df83307ebe80d780495b55493453
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DE5B9B47_1A1E_40BC_B96E_D4A5B1CFF55C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The wanderer knocking on the door that day was the very same fair-skinned young woman who "
"visited the mansion so many years earlier."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La visiteuse qui frappa à la porte ce jour-là se trouvait être la même jeune femme au teint "
"éclatant qui était venue au manoir tant d’années auparavant."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A12E6328_D57E_43F8_BB1B_8C4C5F88215D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85729d8dad62a36a956df0ff80a3d820dbd1ca230b572547b50dead5c74514dd
#. default-sha256: 545ff499e502c0435cc32c44835610e0b55922d8e1b35381e8904930b30b8bfa
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A12E6328_D57E_43F8_BB1B_8C4C5F88215D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl must have spent many, many a night in the forest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs avait dû passer de très nombreuses nuits dans la forêt."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E877D490_31D4_4AAE_A8F4_3729423D1083
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1bc49e5d775ff84e124c4dca2629413c0975349fffa84a6754914fbe756e878
#. default-sha256: 393d7c45483a0fc4517447cc429c661e70774ca2fc8d9cf2d19e790a24b784e2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E877D490_31D4_4AAE_A8F4_3729423D1083"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her crystalline skin was covered in red scratches from where she had brushed against stray "
"branches and tree bark. She had even lost her shoes, and was standing there barefooted, looking "
"quite disheartened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sa peau cristalline était couverte d’égratignures dues aux branchages et aux écorces. Elle "
"avait même perdu ses chaussures et marchait pieds-nus ; elle semblait vraiment en détresse."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CBB6BF74_20E5_4572_B7D3_72A11D316931
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f52e379db6bf3126db60b89e62a7b446d8236341ea10ae604b283272cb74b00f
#. default-sha256: 004f2ee4690afad15c7d1f8f5c8d1ade1225b14f8b4cf9ecf05aa60e9d51ec94
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CBB6BF74_20E5_4572_B7D3_72A11D316931"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that did not make her any less beautiful. In fact, you could just imagine the dense "
"forest canopy parting to allow the sun to shine down upon her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais ça ne la rendait pas moins belle. En fait, on pouvait aisément imaginer la dense "
"canopée de la forêt s’écarter pour permettre au soleil de l’illuminer."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F2F71829_F774_4155_83C7_9178873C2A08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3beecc3ecb541d1d16f6cce38fd006b6677157a09cecc1e86de08b42f786da9
#. default-sha256: 1c812955ab9bac78e3a90e06d812791e1961c834f796f1436b7f9a497f0f3238
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F2F71829_F774_4155_83C7_9178873C2A08"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9F0927F3_EB0A_49F1_8830_CBE0CA231BCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a7b71dc598e2cd6ae9ccb5610bd5b7456251f624b59bb28c8e70a063ea26726
#. default-sha256: 6ec4bd01f210beb5ac85a7fd021d052bbdacbb3f935ce1205557a0d141ed8f59
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9F0927F3_EB0A_49F1_8830_CBE0CA231BCA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The beast appeared surprised by her angelic beauty as well. ⟪k:1⟫It seemed as though all the "
"madness drained from him in that moment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La bête se montra tout aussi surprise par cette beauté angélique. ⟪k:1⟫On aurait dit que "
"toute sa folie s’était évaporée en un instant."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6EF0A4AB_CE19_4C16_9E79_AFFE0E0D292A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cadbcb08fbd930be85c33b19dc96b2eefbc804e8cfc46e4a5816cbdb741b5abf
#. default-sha256: 73240080bf46069c38289e19b43c8d9b2ccd9eb4857ef2fde459e62c16247d8d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6EF0A4AB_CE19_4C16_9E79_AFFE0E0D292A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫....................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫....................."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6D4B969B_BC5B_41D1_90C0_4EC4FFA290FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6e61767f19c97c931dae52c6b7ff52cc2a05aed3a8f71552b923f55af741020
#. default-sha256: 25f69ed66168a01acb6bf3886c157eada398ab4945e499ee8e53366351b8a224
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6D4B969B_BC5B_41D1_90C0_4EC4FFA290FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He said nothing, but his eyes told all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il ne disait rien, mais ses yeux en disaient long."

#: scenario2:scenario2_856FAEE0_BDA3_42B9_8042_E2231EE27056
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66504c801b3a9683b84ecf8e628f57b6d8a792859fad1a8ea4a502b3ba262db3
#. default-sha256: 6aa751bf11b9f5a05254e1007942af831b173ec4e90fa171c817e6417c57f700
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_856FAEE0_BDA3_42B9_8042_E2231EE27056"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was entranced by the sight of her ruby-red irises and her pure-white hair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il était fasciné par ses yeux rouges rubis et ses cheveux d’un blanc pur."

#: scenario2:scenario2_946B9368_56E5_4E47_A332_72BA658DC90A
