#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43c058fea77251d84935169a91ec556cd970c9ecb6f80130ac1a35fa5afce7f6
#. default-sha256: 704a6dbf91393b52b4f0c11f72c6412bb5288dcf69037e7e23c08a2dea1e2a0a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7CC04AB0_BDC5_4F3D_BD21_1CD11CB78737"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Taken in the throes of his primal urges, the beast had not noticed, but there was an "
"emptiness in the girl’s eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pressé par ses besoins primaires, la bête n’avait pas remarqué que les yeux de la fille "
"regardaient dans le vide."

#: scenario2:scenario2_651C1431_471A_41B0_B289_FA29C125ADDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8dba84d359b68cb11f318a910de36cc53ec101f5a1ce426d3ac22a5aa957866
#. default-sha256: 82e043069d0b84333b21f208b0e4142cd5f21ebef58b9fe2aae0f61f3937db58
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_651C1431_471A_41B0_B289_FA29C125ADDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She appeared to be gazing far into the distance, not focused on the man despite being close "
"enough to touch him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle semblait fixer un point très éloigné alors même que l’homme était assez proche pour la "
"toucher."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2B91BD3B_8E75_43F8_A27C_2C9A1CE8968A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3359524592b5e58240e726d54abcc527b0f408a70beeaf1effa916d12bbdf62
#. default-sha256: ea70f7f06c213a473b4e1def6751c977628cf89d73c3d6c2489ad2602bc1834e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2B91BD3B_8E75_43F8_A27C_2C9A1CE8968A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tears had begun running down Bestia’s cheeks earlier—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫when she had called him a "
"person."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Des larmes avaient commencé à couler sur les joues de Bestia—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ quand elle lui avait "
"dit qu’il était une personne."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A8CC8189_A609_4FA4_8E7B_3113430A1ED6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5362a7216623ffe94dbb743574d89cbbf0684ca6f4074197105c76e1fec168c
#. default-sha256: 4745f16af416c002150dc2f0a3358b0786885c89e63fed7587c03834df5fb069
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A8CC8189_A609_4FA4_8E7B_3113430A1ED6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not until one of those droplets had slid across the back of her finger that she "
"had realized."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais elle ne s’en était rendu compte que lorsqu’une goutte avait glissé au bout de son doigt."

#: scenario2:scenario2_BD87C6E1_2308_4BB1_B95E_E41A9B2AD812
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71416b6ffa74d594ba525f09a4fba137681b15973b6f07ecbea5e8b0a37a689a
#. default-sha256: 612ed78827b61e206aebecd086a086427a1f403869a3c2513f925f2e7f4147a9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BD87C6E1_2308_4BB1_B95E_E41A9B2AD812"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She would, indeed, have no need of extravagant dresses—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫after all, she could not "
"see what she was wearing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle n’avait, en effet, nul besoin de robes extravagantes—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ après tout, elle était "
"incapable de voir ce qu’elle portait."

#: scenario2:scenario2_645A19A9_4D1A_45F3_8D14_DF9B0BBD9175
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56d324c1ec14ae9f8de8c9f0f636b16da1795208cff1823e58136f4624a33064
#. default-sha256: 9c89be3f25ab3d2bec6f5e36981a8ba5994f93accd253823f39901768052aebd
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_645A19A9_4D1A_45F3_8D14_DF9B0BBD9175"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That is correct; I am blind...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But who ever decided that reality is only that which "
"can be seen?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’est juste ; je suis aveugle...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mais qui a dit que la réalité ne pouvait être "
"appréciée que par la⟪k:3⟫vision ?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3520CD30_9B22_4B24_A869_88E7B38DC357
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bab3b0df188b41e7086ebe35123a8a7fc40bb82c46697e8382d295811c3dd4e1
#. default-sha256: c29f5e07772bc585f6ff38ee81eed2dd72406310d2fd13e95adde18a3847ae2a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3520CD30_9B22_4B24_A869_88E7B38DC357"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I know not what appearance I have."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je ne connais pas mon apparence."

#: scenario2:scenario2_590045A2_5DA3_4579_A391_E1875D295C2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4019caa65ddd81f4442147b8437832d2d5a179cb32b9c05488c4e55b31597f51
#. default-sha256: 6094129f4ee2125e3e02b2e8ba687850dd988008b9972279d96cba5d75d90edd
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_590045A2_5DA3_4579_A391_E1875D295C2A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In the darkness, everything is as one;⟪k:1⟫there is no difference between beast and man.⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫If you are a beast, then I too must be a beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dans l’obscurité, tout se ressemble ;⟪k:1⟫il n’y a aucune différence entre un homme et une "
"bête.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Si vous êtes une bête, alors moi aussi je dois en être une."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D4A42BCC_B63F_4D0F_946B_5E2A96A08F12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0995c582ffcb89ffce36e097768667d864fc91aa11206750baadbc25743c68c9
#. default-sha256: 35256590222b767207b6604bbd94e1473990ef8aeb867657bd5a19d14c218c49
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D4A42BCC_B63F_4D0F_946B_5E2A96A08F12"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To call the girl a beast would be paramount to eating sugar and insisting it was salt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il aurait été ridicule de l’appeler ainsi— tout autant que de manger du sucre et d’insister "
"que c’était du sel."

#: scenario2:scenario2_67032F47_2055_44A8_ABA4_DAA196713B97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85f08c46b6b6f7bab8e3b7927efe165ab67b2af845bfa0f11c81ff0af3d86ab7
#. default-sha256: efd8f1078bb48cba6c74f572b68b03d97d3d001d54584a4f5962cb16f3b102c1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_67032F47_2055_44A8_ABA4_DAA196713B97"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Do pardon the trite analogy, please."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Veuillez pardonner cette comparaison triviale, je vous prie."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C28C27E1_5C6E_40FF_9B28_D04C6F0819BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b214996689c0f0e343613ef7ec2c282c600dfe1e34ef04cef072441d1dffb5d
#. default-sha256: 903e3ff17a14b3bfec0fa3ed635391377b71206792570c9540409306db575c42
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C28C27E1_5C6E_40FF_9B28_D04C6F0819BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But you know rather well, Master, that the White-Haired Girl was not at all what you would "
"call a beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais vous savez bien, Maître, que la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs n’était pas du tout ce qu’on "
"pourrait appeler une bête."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C5F8E918_0E88_4054_BC3A_7461BBBD5E9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b0cd97b063fe2fa4d5491985e14376a0b08720f55809d1b76ee288c36787aab
#. default-sha256: 01dd8e3f88a89019c91c2170175853b2bca717f95475b8191d9db35bc4ccd03f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C5F8E918_0E88_4054_BC3A_7461BBBD5E9E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not simply in appearance, but all the way down to her core. There was nothing beastly about "
"her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pas seulement en apparence, mais également en son for intérieur. Il n’y avait rien de "
"bestial en elle."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C92FAF2A_FEB5_4F72_9017_4460FD097624
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ae1475a16da169ce4de8f779b20639aa772982c056b66933d9f25153aeba58f
